["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/fixedIn", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A `from` /Security/Vulnerability has been fixed in each `to` Element. The use of the `fixedIn` type is constrained to `/Security/VexFixedVulnAssessmentRelationship` classed relationships.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
